1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,960
Let's watch Ana and Ben play a whole game. We'll slow down for the big moments and fast-forward the rest.

2
00:00:06,633 --> 00:00:16,147
Ana is at the bottom, Ben at the top. The bowl starts with a green, a purple, a blue and a red, and Ana's Take Two Stones card starts face down.

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,893
Turn 1. Ana: Add Two Stones and Take One.

4
00:00:20,566 --> 00:00:23,147
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone and a white.

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,719
She gives a green stone to the Salmon.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,021
Let's skip ahead a few turns.

7
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,406
Turn 5. Ana plays Spirit Power, and picks the Wolf.

8
00:00:36,066 --> 00:00:38,669
Into the bowl: a red, two purple and a blue.

9
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:41,231
She gives a yellow stone to the Salmon.

10
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,180
A few quick turns.

11
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,754
Turn 8. Ben plays Spirit Power, and picks the Bison.

12
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:53,036
Into the bowl: two Spirit Stones and a red.

13
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,492
He gives a red stone to the Rabbit.

14
00:00:56,166 --> 00:01:01,180
Then the Bison sends a Spirit Stone back into the bag. That keeps the game going longer.

15
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:05,052
Turn 9. Ana: Take One Stone.

16
00:01:05,733 --> 00:01:11,514
She puts a Spirit Stone on the Salmon's times-two space. Double points, and that animal is closed.

17
00:01:12,166 --> 00:01:13,276
Fast forward.

18
00:01:13,933 --> 00:01:17,538
Turn 11. Ana: Add Three Stones and Move Coyote.

19
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,314
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone, a white and a purple.

20
00:01:21,966 --> 00:01:24,292
And the Coyote jumps onto Ben's Turtle.

21
00:01:24,966 --> 00:01:27,142
That's three Spirit Stones out of the bag.

22
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:28,866
Skipping ahead.

23
00:01:29,533 --> 00:01:33,053
Turn 13. Ana plays Spirit Power, and picks the Eagle.

24
00:01:33,733 --> 00:01:35,589
She gives a white stone to the Beaver.

25
00:01:37,266 --> 00:01:39,591
And thanks to the Eagle, Ana plays again!

26
00:01:40,266 --> 00:01:41,397
Quick turns now.

27
00:01:45,466 --> 00:01:49,114
Turn 17. Ben plays Spirit Power, and picks the Deer.

28
00:01:49,766 --> 00:01:53,009
The Deer moves a red stone from his Rabbit back to the bowl.

29
00:01:53,666 --> 00:01:57,207
He gives a white stone to the Turtle and a blue stone to the Rabbit.

30
00:01:58,866 --> 00:02:00,488
Let's skip ahead a few turns.

31
00:02:01,166 --> 00:02:03,556
Turn 19. Ben: Take Two Stones.

32
00:02:04,233 --> 00:02:07,859
He gives a red stone to the Rabbit and a yellow stone to the Rabbit.

33
00:02:08,533 --> 00:02:11,967
Turn 20. Ana plays Spirit Power, and picks the Ram.

34
00:02:12,633 --> 00:02:20,931
The Ram puts a red and a Spirit Stone straight from the bag: a red stone to the Rabbit and a Spirit Stone on the Rabbit's times-two space.

35
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:24,690
That's four Spirit Stones out of the bag.

36
00:02:25,366 --> 00:02:28,012
Turn 21. Ben: Take One Stone.

37
00:02:28,666 --> 00:02:34,469
He puts a Spirit Stone on the Rabbit's times-two space. Double points, and that animal is closed.

38
00:02:35,133 --> 00:02:38,632
Turn 22. Ana: Add Two Stones and Take One.

39
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:41,796
Into the bowl: a Spirit Stone and a blue.

40
00:02:42,466 --> 00:02:44,301
She gives a green stone to the Owl.

41
00:02:44,966 --> 00:02:47,121
That's five Spirit Stones out of the bag.

42
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:51,405
Five Spirit Stones are out at the end of the turn. Game over!

43
00:02:52,066 --> 00:02:56,248
Ana: Rabbit 12, Turtle 1 and Salmon 18. 31 points.

44
00:02:56,900 --> 00:03:01,486
Ben: Rabbit 12, Turtle 3, Owl 4 and Beaver 10. 29 points.

45
00:03:02,166 --> 00:03:05,388
Ana wins, 31 to 29! Thanks for watching.
